on><option value="E. This could encourage creativity.">E. This could encourage creativity.</option><option value="F. This could lead to social problems.">F. This could lead to social problems.</option><option value="G. This could enable retired people to share a project.">G. This could enable retired people to share a project.</option><option value="H. This would help some people but cause problems for others.">H. This would help some people but cause problems for others.</option><option value="I. This would suit both existing and new members of a household.">I. This would suit both existing and new members of a household.</option></select></span></div></div>                                                                        <div class="options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching" data-dnd-group="3178493">
